{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222050","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1522205001:0":{"text":"뭐 하는 거지? 군대가 허수아비로 보이나?","source_cn":"谁敢动手？！真当军队都是摆设吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A86B303D1691747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522205002:0":{"text":"보칼리스의 구호 식량은 당연히 <style=\"highlight\">보칼리스인이라면 누구나 받을 자격이 있다</style>. 돈이 있든 없든, 다 상관 없어!","source_cn":"呼临城的赈灾粮，自然<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BCB9ED3E6EE41F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522205003:0":{"text":"계속 시끄럽게 굴면 전부 감옥에 처넣을 줄 알아!","source_cn":"要是谁再闹事，就等着被我关进牢里去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA041A46751A393F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522205004:1":{"text":"...그건 목숨이 걸린 구호 식량이라고! 어떻게 이럴 수 있어?","source_cn":"——那些是救命的粮食！你怎么能这么做？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3943597FC2139A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522205005:0":{"text":"꺼져, 꺼져! 부관님 말씀 못 들었냐?","source_cn":"去去去！没听到副将大人都发话了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868640084EFAEAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1522205006:0":{"text":"계속 시끄럽게 굴면 감옥에 처넣을 줄 알라잖아!","source_cn":"你要是再闹事，就等着被投牢吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C99188397E6ADA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522205007:0":{"text":"하하하... 이렇게 웃긴 일이 다 있을 줄이야.","source_cn":"哈哈……没想到还有这么好笑的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB260A5978D7C272F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522205008:0":{"text":"그런데 말이야, 너희가 짜고 친다는 걸 페르세우스가 알고는 있나? 너희끼리 수군거리면서 <style=\"highlight\">구호 식량을 챙긴 거</style> 말이야.","source_cn":"我很好奇，你们商量好的事告诉珀尔修斯了吗？他知道你们<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CBB2B59D8108C47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522205009:0":{"text":"그, 그게 무슨 말이지? 겨, 경고하는데 허튼소리 하지 마라!","source_cn":"你……你这话几个意思？！我、我警告你，不要血口喷人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7880DD33040840AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522205010:1":{"text":"맞아요. 페르세우스가 여러분에게 벌을 내릴 거예요.","source_cn":"他没有说错。珀尔修斯会惩罚你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DBD57C926995BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522205011:0":{"text":"닥쳐라, 이 짐승아!","source_cn":"闭嘴，你这野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646E90A0E3DD95F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1522205011":{"text":"닥쳐라, 이 짐승아!","source_cn":"闭嘴，你这野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646E90A0E3DD95F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522205014:0":{"text":"로르 부관님, 비가 내리면 가뭄은 해소될 수 있지만, 보칼리스의 기근은 단시간 안에 해결할 수 있는 것이 아니에요.","source_cn":"隆尔副将，干旱尚可盼望一场大雨缓解，但呼临城的饥荒绝非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2EA08E6678BF8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522205015:0":{"text":"저장된 식량이 한정된 지금은 <style=\"highlight\">더 큰 피해를 입고 굶주린 사람들에게 먼저 식량을 배급하는 것</style>이 좋다고 생각해요. 급한 불을 먼저 꺼야죠.","source_cn":"在存粮有限的境况下，以我拙见，<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE874FD99CCE4024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522205016:0":{"text":"어떻게 생각하나요?","source_cn":"你认为呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2889209D717D19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522205017